{"id": "p004-008", "text": "Long catch up w/ Nasser @ the wall. he's entering a bouldering comp in Sheffield next Sat, bit nervous tbh. wife not thrilled lol. their eldest just got picked for the county chess squad, Nasser beaming. also he's reading the new Mick Herron, keeps telling me to start Slow Horses", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Nasser", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "bouldering comp", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "wish_luck"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next Sat", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "nervous", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "wife", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "not thrilled", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "eldest", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "got picked for the county chess squad", "owner": "r2", "event_type": "other", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Nasser", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "beaming", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Mick Herron", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i2", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Slow Horses", "owner": "p1"}]}
