{"id": "p004-022", "text": "Lunch w/ Giulia + Luca. Luca's mum had a fall last wk - broken wrist, so he's driving up to Glasgow Fri to help out for a few days. Giulia's sister being induced Mon too, first grandchild on that side so everyone's on edge. Luca still doing pottery, gave us a very lopsided mug lol", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Giulia", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Luca", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Luca", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "fall", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "last wk", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "broken wrist", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "driving up to Glasgow", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Fri", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "a few days", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Giulia", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "sister", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "being induced", "owner": "r2", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "Mon", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Luca", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "pottery", "owner": "p2"}]}
